  "description": "<p>Currently migration-utils is configured in the <tt>logback.xml</tt> file to show DEBUG output for the <tt>org.fcrepo.migration</tt> classes:</p>\n\n\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\n&lt;logger name=<span class=\"code-quote\">\"org.fcrepo.migration\"</span> additivity=<span class=\"code-quote\">\"<span class=\"code-keyword\">false</span>\"</span> level=<span class=\"code-quote\">\"DEBUG\"</span>&gt;\r\n &lt;appender-ref ref=<span class=\"code-quote\">\"STDOUT\"</span>/&gt;\r\n &lt;/logger&gt;</pre>\n</div></div>\n\n<p>Change the level to \"INFO\", then verify that the level is set to DEBUG only when the utility is run with the  <tt>--debug</tt> flag.</p>",
